   491	#  RN and RN2 (refusals), set to a NON-default model by OV, and set EMPTY by every other row.  (v4 said "every other row disables it" beside FB1/FB2, which D1-D4 refuted;
   492	#  GLM 5.3, v4 pass.)
   493	three FB1 8 0 0 FX="$T/fx/N1"
